  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the organizational capacity of the Atacamea Community of Toconce (CAT)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indigenous communities in the region of Antofagasta Chile have historically faced challenges in having their needs heard. The IAF supports community-led solutions to strengthen the governance of organizations that can represent community voices to local officials and other relevant institutions. Our grantee Fundacin Huella Local (FHL) works closely with community members of the Atacamea community of Toconce. It offers community members training and technical assistance to expand participation in decisions that affect community members&apos; lives increase the capacity of local leaders to manage community projects and create a multi-stakeholder platform to mobilize resources to solve community needs.</narrative>
  </description>
